  "details": "   * CVE-2026-3238: source4 WINS server NULL pointer dereference in\n     nbtd_winsserver_register/query/release(); craft NBT packets with\n     qdcount=0, arcount=0, or empty netbios addresses crash the nbt process\n     on servers running `wins support = yes` (typical AD DC role). Fix\n     dissolves direct variable initialization and adds NBTD_ASSERT_PACKET\n     qdcount/arcount/length validation before any packet array dereference.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-3238.patch\n     - CVE-2026-3238",
